      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "For someone like you to repeatedly attempt to\r\ninfiltrate the temple I protect, the creature\r\n\"Shelly-chan\" must be a powerful foe\r\nbeyond my imagination.",
        "Jp" : "貴様ほどの者が護る神殿に\r\nそう何度も侵入を試みるとは\r\n俺の想像を超える強力な魔物なのだろう"
